flowchart LR
    %% how one path is classified
    path[Path in the scan] --> known{In the index?}
    known -- no --> sameSum{Checksum of a vanished path?}
    sameSum -- yes --> moved[Moved: rename in place, no reparse]
    sameSum -- no --> new[New: parse and insert]
    known -- yes --> changed{Checksum changed?}
    changed -- no --> same[Unchanged]
    changed -- yes --> modified[Modified: reparse]
    gone[Indexed path not on disk] --> claimed{Claimed by a new file?}
    claimed -->|yes| moved
    claimed -->|no| deleted[Deleted]

    style moved fill:#e8f5e9
    style deleted fill:#fdecea
